OL,3,GNEWSA'Failure to monitor' psychiatric
OL,4,Apatient's killer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of a psychiatric patient, who
OL,7,Fwas killed in a secure mental health
OL,8,Funit, could not have been prevented by
OL,9,Fmedical staff but there was a "failure
OL,10,Fto monitor" his killer, an inquest has
OL,11,Ffound.
OL,13,FFellow patient Ahsan Zia, 33, punched,
OL,14,Fkicked and stamped on Michael Matthews,
OL,15,F55, at Hadrian Clinic in Newcastle on
OL,16,F13 April 2022.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
PN,39402
SC,0002
CT,3,C
