OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F394A1790337351
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Failure to monitor' psychiatric
OL,4,Apatient's killer
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatthews suffered extensive head and
OL,7,Ffacial injuries in the 28 second attack
OL,8,Fin his room on the acute Fellside wing
OL,9,Fand went into cardiac arrest. He died
OL,10,Fin Newcastle's Royal Victoria Infirmary
OL,11,Ffour days later.
OL,13,FCumbria, Northumbria, Tyne and Wear NHS
OL,14,FFoundation Trust told the inquest
OL,15,Fchanges to working practices have been
OL,16,Fmade in light of the incident.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
